			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 411130715,
					"content": "Any junior fortune-teller could have told you this, but... That man was a Fatui Harbinger! That was too close, how did you manage to get caught up with a guy like him?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130716,
					"content": "A Fatui Harbinger? Why, their wickedness knows no bounds!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130717,
					"content": "A Harbinger? Goodness...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130718
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411130718,
					"content": "Whatever he was planning to do... He was heading straight for you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130719,
					"content": "And he is an extremely powerful individual! I sensed it the moment I looked at him. He's far more powerful than you'd imagine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130720,
					"content": "As much as it pains me to admit it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130721,
					"content": "Surely his power cannot match that of the astrological genius of the century?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130722,
					"content": "I never said that...! His strength may exceed mine by a hair's breadth... But in astrology alone, he doesn't come close!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130723,
					"content": "This reminds Paimon of something... We ran into some Fatui at Wangshu Inn, too!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130724,
					"content": "What interest could the Fatui have in the meteorites?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130725,
					"content": "They must be plotting something.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130726,
					"content": "Hmm... Maybe, just maybe...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130727,
					"content": "Oh! The Fatui are the ones who caused the meteor shower in the first place! Was that it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130728,
					"content": "Paimon, that was my line! Get your own!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130729,
					"content": "Sorry... Paimon's mouth just works so much faster than everyone else's.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130730
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130730,
					"content": "Does the power to summon a meteorite strike really exist?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130731
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411130731,
					"content": "Yeah... Where'd they get the power to pull stars out of the sky!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130732,
					"content": "Ozvaldo Hrafnavins, what is thy opinion?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130733
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130733,
					"content": "I think that anything is possible, mein Fräulein.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130734,
					"content": "So long as they can afford to pay the price, they will never stop sowing their seeds of destruction across the land... Fatui, your sins shall not go unremembered.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130735
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130735,
					"content": "I also believe that miracles can happen.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130736,
					"content": "Astral emissary, you have performed admirably as a member of my retinue. I will dispatch my forces to protect you, and they will ensure that the encroaching darkness shall bring you no harm.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130737
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130737,
					"content": "She means me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130738,
					"content": "No need! Paimon thinks that our current lineup works just fine... No need to fix it if it ain't broke!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130739
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130739,
					"content": "You underestimate me, Fischl! I'm far stronger than you seem to think.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130740
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130740,
					"content": "Mein Fräulein trusts no one more than yourself, my lady, she is simply concerned for your well-being.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130741
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Oz"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130741,
					"content": "There's really no need. In any case, you're in a much more perilous position than I am. If anything, you need my protection.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130742,
						411130744
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130742,
					"content": "Mona, you're a good person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130743
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411130743,
					"content": "...Huh? Wh—What're you saying that for?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130746
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130746,
					"content": "For now, we must deal with the new threat. My astrolabe tells me that a new meteorite has landed, and it's the <color=#00E1FFFF>biggest one yet</color>.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Mona"
				},
				{
					"id": 411130744,
					"content": "Fischl, you're a good person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130745
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411130745,
					"content": "Naturally!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411130746
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fischl"
				}
			]
		},
